# Docker gives an ignore file named after its Dockerfile, placed in the same folder,
# priority over the root .dockerignore.
#
# This one uses an allowlist: exclude everything, then admit only what the image needs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!llm-api-smoke-test/pyproject.toml
!courses/cs50_harvard/code/05_data_structures/speller/py_src/pyproject.toml
!foundations/pyproject.toml
!foundations/README.md
!foundations/src/
!foundations/sql/
**/__pycache__
